\\
  We give an explicit description of the orbits of the split real form
$G_{2(2)}$ on the complex flag manifolds of $G_2$ and study their induced
invariant CR structures. In particular we study their Levi forms and show that
all possible cases in the simple homogeneous setting occur, namely Levi
nondegeneracy, $k$-nondegeneracy for $2\leq k\leq 3$, and holomorphic
